{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/2c131587713ac73c3d57db5f0ee8d87c.avif?t=1767540792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras_big/2c131587713ac73c3d57db5f0ee8d87c.webp?t=1767540792 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Ilya, a girl who has lost her memory, trapped inside a strange and complex building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a high-difficulty escape game where every action has consequences, and a single wrong decision can make escape impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The &quot;Step&quot; System: Time is Moving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/74fae2f0cd7b490a7e001fcfe260d210.avif?t=1767540792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras_big/74fae2f0cd7b490a7e001fcfe260d210.webp?t=1767540792 width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action you take advances a <strong>&quot;Step,&quot;</strong> causing the environment to change. For example, imagine a door that stays open for only 10 steps after a switch is pressed. You must pass through, complete your task, and return before the time runs out. A single wasted move could lead to you being trapped forever. Your fate depends on the order of your actions and the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weight System: Item Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/ec2e6064dcac49fc8d3d270c4affc102.avif?t=1767540792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras_big/ec2e6064dcac49fc8d3d270c4affc102.webp?t=1767540792 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item has a <strong>&quot;Weight Value.&quot;</strong> The heavier your total load, the more steps a single action will consume. In a situation where you could move 10 times while unburdened, a heavy load might limit you to only 5 moves. Deciding which items to carry\u2014and which to leave behind\u2014is the ultimate key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the Mystery or Sacrifice Your Partner?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/1c349b2422dfed84ddcd6237a646eaa9.avif?t=1767540792\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside your partner robot lies a <strong>&quot;Black Key&quot;</strong> essential for your escape. By dismantling him, you can bypass the riddles and escape immediately. However, doing so will cause him to cease all functions\u2014meaning you will effectively <strong>&quot;kill&quot;</strong> your only companion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Game Streaming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming of both the <strong>Demo</strong> and the <strong>Full Version</strong> is permitted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kindly ask that you include a link to the game's store page in your video description.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Ilya, the girl with amnesia, out of this mysterious and labyrinthine complex.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055020?t=1767540792","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055020?t=1767540792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/3f2c47c53eaa81d072f921994a5a9838672b44cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767540792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/3f2c47c53eaa81d072f921994a5a9838672b44cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767540792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4055550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/2c131587713ac73c3d57db5f0ee8d87c.avif?t=1767540792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras_big/2c131587713ac73c3d57db5f0ee8d87c.webp?t=1767540792 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Ilya, a girl who has lost her memory, trapped inside a strange and complex building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a high-difficulty escape game where every action has consequences, and a single wrong decision can make escape impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The &quot;Step&quot; System: Time is Moving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras/74fae2f0cd7b490a7e001fcfe260d210.avif?t=1767540792\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055020/extras_big/74fae2f0cd7b490a7e001fcfe260d210.webp?t=1767540792 width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"